    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to SHOTBALL </strong>, the chaotic fusion of football and explosive combat. Armed with your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >trusty shotgun and a set of wild abilities, you'll team up in intense 3v3 matches to outscore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your rivals. With advanced movement and customizable loadouts, every match is a chance to forge your path to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot Everything!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Shotball, your shotgun is your best friend. Blast the ball across the field to set up the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perfect goal, knock your opponents off their game, or even send your teammates flying to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >reposition them in an instant. Every shot counts, so aim wisely... or shoot wildly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Advanced Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision and speed are key to dominating the field. Jump, Slide and Wall-ride to outplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your opponents and reach the perfect position. The field is your playground, and your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >movement skills will make or break your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Wild Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide of the match with powerful abilities designed to disrupt, defend, and dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're teleporting around the field, shielding your team, or causing explosive chaos,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your abilities can change the game in an instant. Use them strategically to gain the upper hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Loadout</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way by choosing from a variety of abilities, weapons, and playstyles to build your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ultimate loadout. Whether you prefer to focus on scoring, supporting your team, or pure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destruction, the choice is yours. Adapt your strategy and find the perfect synergy to lead your team to victory!</p>",
